  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c12f5ac8cbadefc15701e873ccdabc3b07ea5a6.png\" alt=\"Killer Queen 附加模組橫幅\"></p>\n<p>一款 Minecraft 模組，透過「替身箭」取得，為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ripples-of-the-past\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ripples of the Past Mod</a> 新增了人型替身<strong>Killer Queen</strong></p>\n<h2>攻擊</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_48db5d88-c7c3-410d-99e0-37f44068b7db.png\" alt=\"拳擊\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">普通拳擊（Shift 鍵變體：&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9c8329d3-7769-4830-8aba-20fdd52a860f.png\" alt=\"重擊\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">重擊）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1457348b-9cb4-4fcd-8459-087e00594f9a.png\" alt=\"衝鋒\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">衝拳（Shift 鍵變體：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9c8329d3-7769-4830-8aba-20fdd52a860f.png\" alt=\"重擊\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">重擊）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_395fc169-7a88-4c34-9960-c02ae3fdb4ca.png\" alt=\"SHA\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">純潔之心</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fb1a55dc-33b0-490c-a3e9-ed2c669d5afe.png\" alt=\"雪球炸彈\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">流浪雪球：發射一顆雪球炸彈，碰撞時會引爆</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>能力</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1f164080-4261-48c0-a4bc-7150a531ecf6.png\" alt=\"實體炸彈\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">第一炸彈（實體）：將單一實體轉化為炸彈</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b8300398-874a-458b-99de-e6e63004782f.png\" alt=\"物品炸彈\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">第一炸彈（物品）：將副手的一件物品轉化為炸彈</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_af459c30-252a-4e93-a226-348eb87447f6.png\" alt=\"方塊炸彈\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">第一炸彈（方塊）：將主世界中的一個方塊轉化為炸彈&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>",
